{"title":"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1.1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1.1</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Parabola\" title=\"Parabola\">parabola</a> with equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/6/ba697e110eb547ec3222ea358ed4c1060ac37887.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=x^2+bx+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"122\" height=\"18\" /> passes through the points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/6/876b66789c31005ef23e41081d8f7c10137faaa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/3/563948106c3332662355412547d99acab218c16f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />.  What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/6/106e80c5637d34b5569709227e8087d276176724.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 2\\qquad \\textbf{(B) } 5\\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 7\\qquad \\textbf{(D) } 10\\qquad \\textbf{(E) } 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"373\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Substitute the points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/6/876b66789c31005ef23e41081d8f7c10137faaa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/3/563948106c3332662355412547d99acab218c16f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" /> into the given equation for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e53b1fe25be1c679117fb44a6a886fe1247d189a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Then we get a system of two equations:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/7/d67b03119d650354b6246295ef681a132f900812.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3=4+2b+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"112\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/e/a3e6cb793fac9cbd617cdd94014b30c46f2d25c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3=16+4b+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"123\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Subtracting the first equation from the second we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/d/cfd88c6c30f2befeb00ac6e768b0058cb844874b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0=12+2b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"90\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/d/66d2f9f4f35bd078f1caef463342467875d525a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=-6$\" width=\"54\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Then using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/d/66d2f9f4f35bd078f1caef463342467875d525a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=-6$\" width=\"54\" height=\"12\" /> in the first equation:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/6/af6e5ec1c50c7276a2b39a34d5b566f1a309d00b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0=1+-12+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"129\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/7/7671f0e1833b4154e7e02ef9412ab7d9a61e44e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"97\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1.1\">Solution 1.1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1.1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Alternatively, notice that since the equation is that of a conic parabola, the vertex is likely <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/9/8790f46883a296366f038323844601dd2cde9ba6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />. Thus, the form of the equation of the parabola is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/d/4ed524279279f436e49f40d20c823e0394a17319.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y - 2 = (x - 3)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"127\" height=\"19\" />. Expanding this out, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/7/7671f0e1833b4154e7e02ef9412ab7d9a61e44e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"97\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The points given have the same <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-value, so the vertex lies on the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/f/90f1f22be9cd8dc7b5b0d8aa40f5f0648164f20a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{2+4}{2}=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"112\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-coordinate of the vertex is also equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/5/b250a7d94be19932d73b6f79e32ec07dbb15e390.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-b}{2a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"24\" height=\"37\" />, so set this equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/a/0daeb25b17a4a869fba32f953619e199b0560500.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{-b}{2a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"58\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/1/341886afc6f3872da3ecc782d809b8bdd84e8124.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3=\\frac{-b}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"57\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/a/faad98146290527b2bade699d0aab6b9f22a3c77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6=-b$\" width=\"55\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/d/66d2f9f4f35bd078f1caef463342467875d525a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=-6$\" width=\"54\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Now the equation is of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/9/4f9c58a92d77e017f54f182d4b84609c5c4c6bde.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=x^2-6x+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"123\" height=\"18\" />.  Now plug in the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/6/876b66789c31005ef23e41081d8f7c10137faaa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> and solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/9/4f9c58a92d77e017f54f182d4b84609c5c4c6bde.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=x^2-6x+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"123\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/8/cf88f4bdfd6e82ac6da19217f9c2db2532e0522d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3=2^2-6(2)+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"134\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/1/fe138cb4436e503159afc5f86fcab209d7d33a92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3=4-12+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"113\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/7/9271809b39c53f0254b2c8f756ff395c0fd14277.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3=-8+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"87\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/7/7671f0e1833b4154e7e02ef9412ab7d9a61e44e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"97\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Substituting y into the two equations, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/7/b974e7c92ca541a3b3aa954a1858094da7634c68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3=x^2+bx+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"122\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Which can be written as:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/e/bee7c465e6bef014c7285ce04bc38d5f3c7410a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+bx+c-3=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"152\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> are the solutions to the quadratic. Thus:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/4/e54fd9d6bbf82d018a1dc16c9b77c8bccda9c929.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c-3=4\\times2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"103\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/4/13462c45c56a1410b5e6b821a5681c8ea1be0695.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c-3=8$\" width=\"72\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/7/7671f0e1833b4154e7e02ef9412ab7d9a61e44e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"97\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A\">2006 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_14\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_22\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_23\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_25\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017144405\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.047 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 325/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2320/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 154/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7832/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   16.013      1 -total\n 63.06%   10.098      1 Template:AMC10_box\n 35.71%    5.719      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2472:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017144405 and revision id 167874. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}